      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report two cases of Kienböck's disease associated with systemic lupus erythematosus SLE. The characteristics of these cases associated with SLE differed from those previously reported for Kienböck's disease. Corticosteroid may be a cause of Kienböck's disease in SLE."},
